---
import type { Locale } from '../../i18n';

interface Props { locale: Locale }
const { locale } = Astro.props;
const zh = locale === 'zh';
const t = (cn: string, en: string) => zh ? cn : en;

const evidenceRoot = 'https://github.com/mykcs/openevo-experiment/blob/476039e9ce82767120db803d57f016db3b1414ce';
const h142Root = 'https://github.com/mykcs/openevo-experiment/blob/d1f35ecdf84c61b07df7c646e83588d63b9297bd';

const gates = [
  {
    id: 'gate-1',
    badge: t('未通过', 'Not cleared'),
    title: t('第一道门 · 学会新经验', 'Gate 1 · Learn new experience'),
    question: t('第二次更新以后，模型还能从新任务里学到东西吗？', 'After the second update, can the model still learn from new tasks?'),
    answer: t(
      '目前没有拿到可信的正向证据，而且关键测量有失效记录。所以只能说“这道门没有通过”，不能说“模型已经失去学习能力”。',
      'We do not yet have trustworthy positive evidence, and a key measurement was invalid. The correct conclusion is that this gate did not clear, not that the model lost the ability to learn.',
    ),
  },
  {
    id: 'gate-2',
    badge: t('未通过', 'Not cleared'),
    title: t('第二道门 · 保住旧能力', 'Gate 2 · Retain prior capability'),
    question: t('学新东西以后，原来会做的任务还能保持吗？', 'After learning something new, does prior capability remain?'),
    answer: t(
      '这是目前最明显的瓶颈。第二次更新以后，旧任务表现出现下降方向，说明“学新”和“保旧”还没有同时做到。',
      'This is the clearest current bottleneck. Performance on earlier tasks moved downward after the second update, so learning new material and retaining old capability have not yet been achieved together.',
    ),
  },
  {
    id: 'gate-3',
    badge: t('未通过', 'Not cleared'),
    title: t('第三道门 · 保住第一代收益', 'Gate 3 · Preserve the first-generation gain'),
    question: t('第一代已经复现的迁移提升，第二次更新以后还能保住吗？', 'Does the replicated first-generation transfer gain survive the second update?'),
    answer: t(
      '没有看到它稳定延续。因为前面的三道门没有全部通过，预留给第二代的新任务迁移测试 T2 也没有启动。',
      'We did not see the gain persist reliably. Because the upstream gates did not all clear, the reserved second-generation fresh-transfer test T2 was never opened.',
    ),
  },
] as const;
---

<section class="g2-ablation" id="g2-ablation" aria-labelledby="g2-ablation-title">
  <header class="section-heading">
    <p>SECOND GENERATION</p>
    <div>
      <h2 id="g2-ablation-title">{t('第二代为什么还不能说“越学越好”？', 'Why can’t we yet say the second generation keeps improving?')}</h2>
      <p>{t(
        '第二次更新确实发生了，也有新的成功经验可以学习。问题在于它必须同时做到三件事：学会新的、别忘旧的、还要保住第一代已经得到的提升。现在这三件事没有同时成立。',
        'The second update genuinely happened, and new successful experience was available. The problem is that three things must hold together: learn the new material, retain the old capability, and preserve the first-generation gain. They did not all hold at once.',
      )}</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="gate-grid">
    {gates.map((gate) => (
      <article class="gate-card" id={gate.id}>
        <div class="gate-top">
          <h3>{gate.title}</h3>
          <span class="gate-badge">{gate.badge}</span>
        </div>
        <p class="gate-question">{gate.question}</p>
        <p class="gate-answer">{gate.answer}</p>
      </article>
    ))}
  </div>

  <details class="evidence-details" id="evidence-g2" name="research-evidence">
    <summary>{t('展开实验依据', 'Expand experiment evidence')}</summary>
    <div class="evidence-detail-body">
      <div class="gate-evidence-grid">
        <section>
          <h3>{t('第一道门 · 新经验获取', 'Gate 1 · New experience acquisition')}</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>{t('H1.41 C0 acquisition（新经验获取）点估计 = 0，但该路径被判为测量无效（MEASUREMENT_INVALID）。', 'H1.41 C0 acquisition point estimate = 0, but the path was classified as MEASUREMENT_INVALID.')}</li>
            <li>{t('H1.40：32 次尝试 / 28 次有效；唯一 4/4 parser-invalid（解析失败）的 cell 属于测量无效，而不是“能力为零”。', 'H1.40: 32 attempts / 28 valid; the single 4/4 parser-invalid cell is measurement-invalid, not zero capability.')}</li>
          </ul>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h3>{t('第二道门 · 旧能力保留', 'Gate 2 · Prior capability retention')}</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>H1.40 retention（旧能力保留）Δ = −0.1635，95% CI [−0.4073, 0.0355]。</li>
            <li>{t('H1.41 校准复测：C0 / C1 的 retention 都是 −0.065625，方向一致为负。', 'H1.41 calibrated re-measurement: retention on both C0 and C1 = −0.065625, consistently negative.')}</li>
          </ul>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h3>{t('第三道门 · 第一代收益保持', 'Gate 3 · Preserve the first-generation gain')}</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>preservation（已有收益保持）Δ = −0.0036，95% CI [−0.0801, 0.0755]，与 0 不可区分。</li>
            <li>{t('预留的 T2 新任务迁移面板没有打开（t2Opened = false），因此不能说 G2 已经在 T2 上证明迁移失败。', 'The reserved T2 fresh-transfer panel never opened (t2Opened = false), so G2 did not prove transfer failure on T2.')}</li>
          </ul>
        </section>
      </div>

      <aside class="mechanism-note">
        <h3>{t('一个值得继续检查的机制线索', 'A mechanism clue worth testing further')}</h3>
        <p>{t(
          'H1.40-MD 对参数的离线分析发现：旧成分系数平均约 0.691，新写入成分约 0.181；同时把经验回放从 62 条历史 + 2 条当前改成 48 + 16 后，遗忘幅度有所收窄。这只是诊断信号，不是因果证明。',
          'The H1.40-MD offline parameter analysis found old-component coefficients averaging about 0.691 versus about 0.181 for newly written components; changing replay from 62 historical + 2 current examples to 48 + 16 also narrowed forgetting. This is a diagnostic signal, not causal proof.',
        )}</p>
      </aside>

      <div class="evidence-link-grid">
        <a href={`${evidenceRoot}/docs/evidence/remote-runs/2026-08-20/h1.40-g2-r2/g2-training-reconciliation-v1.json`} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
          <small>Machine result</small><span>{t('G2 训练对账', 'G2 training reconciliation')}</span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b>
        </a>
        <a href={`${evidenceRoot}/docs/evidence/remote-runs/2026-08-20/h1.40-g2-r2/formal-upstream-evaluation-v5b-summary.json`} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
          <small>Machine result</small><span>{t('正式上游评估摘要', 'Formal upstream summary')}</span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b>
        </a>
        <a href={`${evidenceRoot}/docs/evidence/remote-runs/2026-08-20/h1.40-g2-r2/FORMAL_UPSTREAM_EVALUATION_REPORT.md`} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
          <small>Human report</small><span>{t('正式上游评估报告', 'Formal upstream evaluation report')}</span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b>
        </a>
        <a href={`${evidenceRoot}/docs/evidence/remote-runs/2026-08-20/h1.40-md/ARTIFACT_AUTOPSY.md`} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
          <small>Human report</small><span>{t('H1.40-MD 参数分析', 'H1.40-MD artifact autopsy')}</span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b>
        </a>
        <a href={`${h142Root}/docs/evidence/remote-runs/2026-08-21/h1.41/H141_RECONCILIATION_V5.md`} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
          <small>Machine result</small><span>{t('H1.41 机制筛选对账', 'H1.41 reconciliation')}</span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b>
        </a>
        <a href={`${h142Root}/docs/evidence/remote-runs/2026-08-21/h1.42-mv/H142_STAGE_B_CLOSEOUT.md`} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
          <small>Human report</small><span>{t('H1.42 Stage B 测量校准收口', 'H1.42 Stage B closeout')}</span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </details>
</section>

<style>
  .g2-ablation{max-width:1160px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px 52px;color:var(--color-text)}
  .section-heading{display:grid;grid-template-columns:145px minmax(0,760px);gap:28px;padding:38px 0 24px;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border)}
  .section-heading>p{margin:5px 0 0;color:var(--color-text-muted);font-size:.73rem;font-weight:750;letter-spacing:.14em}
  .section-heading h2{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:clamp(1.55rem,3vw,2.5rem);line-height:1.12;letter-spacing:-.035em}
  .section-heading div>p{margin:0;max-width:68ch;color:var(--color-text-muted);font-size:.94rem;line-height:1.68}
  .gate-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px}
  .gate-card{padding:20px;border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:15px;background:var(--color-bg)}
  .gate-top{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px}
  .gate-card h3{margin:0;font-size:1.02rem;line-height:1.35;letter-spacing:-.02em}
  .gate-badge{flex-shrink:0;padding:3px 9px;border:1px solid var(--color-danger);border-radius:999px;color:var(--color-danger);font-size:.66rem;font-weight:750}
  .gate-question{margin:12px 0 0;color:var(--color-text);font-size:.82rem;font-weight:700;line-height:1.55}
  .gate-answer{margin:8px 0 0;color:var(--color-text-muted);font-size:.8rem;line-height:1.65}
  .evidence-details{margin-top:14px;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border)}
  .evidence-details summary{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;cursor:pointer;padding:14px 0 2px;color:var(--color-accent);font-size:.78rem;font-weight:750;list-style:none}
  .evidence-details summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
  .evidence-details summary::after{content:'＋';font-weight:500}
  .evidence-details[open] summary::after{content:'−'}
  .evidence-detail-body{padding:12px 0 2px}
  .gate-evidence-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:8px}
  .gate-evidence-grid section{padding:14px;border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:12px;background:var(--color-surface)}
  .gate-evidence-grid h3{margin:0;font-size:.82rem;line-height:1.45}
  .gate-evidence-grid ul{margin:10px 0 0;padding-left:18px;display:grid;gap:7px}
  .gate-evidence-grid li{color:var(--color-text-muted);font-size:.75rem;line-height:1.58;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
  .mechanism-note{margin-top:10px;padding:16px;border:1px dashed var(--color-border);border-radius:12px;background:var(--color-surface)}
  .mechanism-note h3{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:.84rem}
  .mechanism-note p{margin:0;max-width:82ch;color:var(--color-text-muted);font-size:.77rem;line-height:1.62}
  .evidence-link-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:7px;margin-top:10px}
  .evidence-link-grid a{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:5px 10px;padding:12px;border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:11px;background:var(--color-surface);color:var(--color-text);text-decoration:none}
  .evidence-link-grid a:hover,.evidence-link-grid a:focus-visible{border-color:var(--color-accent)}
  .evidence-link-grid small{grid-column:1;color:var(--color-accent);font:700 .65rem ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace}
  .evidence-link-grid span{grid-column:1;font-size:.76rem;line-height:1.45;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
  .evidence-link-grid b{grid-column:2;grid-row:1 / span 2;align-self:center;color:var(--color-accent)}
  @media(max-width:960px){
    .gate-grid,.gate-evidence-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  }
  @media(max-width:720px){
    .g2-ablation{padding-inline:18px}
    .section-heading{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:8px}
    .evidence-link-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  }
</style>